  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4ed5f55d63a8a14cb8fc3f6624472bf, type: 3}
  m_Name: firstPainting
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  key: firstPainting
  charName: Art, the Creativity Spren
  dialogue:
  - This place feels more museumy already! Now, one final thing before I let you
    go for the day!
  - While you've placed a couple painting frames on the walls, an empty frame isn't
    likely to garner many donations from visitors. Let's fill them in with some iconic
    works of art created by world renown painter - YOU!
  - When looking at a single card in the archive, press Q to retrieve it. You can
    then bring it to the placed painting frame, interact with it, and voila! Your
    work will be displayed for all to see!
  - Cards with a higher mastery level will hold visitor interest longer, so be sure
    you are displaying your finest works. You can always tell the mastery tier at
    a glance by the color of the frame.
  - Now go display one of those masterpieces you worked so hard to create and sort!
    Remember, press Q to remove a card from the Archives.
  outlineTag: Archives
